title: "ECG arrhythmia classification on microcontroller-class wearables: code, weights and per-beat predictions"
abstract: "Code, trained FP32 and INT8 weights, the exact record and beat lists for every partition, the environment specification, the seeds and the per-beat predictions supporting a single-lead beat classifier for microcontroller-class hardware evaluated under an inter-patient partition."
